    narr:generatedFrom "ad04a3a27fda51a34aa1cc4245a90f81ad85be89" ;
    narr:narration """This hub gathers a tight cluster of deployment-safety commitments, all dated 20260714 and attributed to QuintonFairweather. The thematic spine is the relationship between *rehearsal* and *real capability*: [the antithesis framing](narr:Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_2) states the principle in its sharpest form — a rollback not rehearsed is not actually possessed — while [the cadence commitment](narr:Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_1) converts that principle into a concrete forward obligation: monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals from this date on. [A restatement in short-punchy register](narr:Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_3) restates the cadence as a structured decision record, and [the ownership assignment](narr:Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_4) names Quinton Fairweather as the accountable individual — anchoring the commitment to a person rather than a process. Two broader narrative nodes frame the interpretive context: [rehearsal-as-reality](narr:Narrative_RollbackRehearsalDiscipline) generalizes the monthly-drill decision into a standing principle, and [named-ownership-as-durability](narr:Narrative_NamedOperationalOwnership) argues that safety decisions only endure when a named individual carries them. The hub does not cover deployment tooling, incident response procedures, monitoring, or risk-acceptance frameworks.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_NamedOperationalOwnership> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RollbackRehearsalDiscipline> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "A rollback\nwe have not rehearsed is a rollback we do not actually have." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Atlas rollback rehearsals run monthly from now on." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Cadence**: monthly Atlas rollback rehearsals" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Owner**: Quinton Fairweather" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Rehearsed Rollback Is the Only Rollback That Counts" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RollbackRehearsalDiscipline> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Accountability Anchors Deployment Safety Decisions" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_NamedOperationalOwnership> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The principle is stated as timeless antithesis (present-realis), but the commitment is framed as future-irrealis — the rehearsals have not yet happened; the gap between declared principle and demonstrated practice is still open." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_1> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Ownership is asserted by Quinton as his own principal, but the cadence restatement is attributed to Session — raising a latent question about whether the commitment is personally owned or procedurally recorded." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_4> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1DirectAfterUnprotectProbe_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The broader narrative nodes generalize the decision into standing principles, but no child here challenges or qualifies whether monthly cadence is sufficient, or whether Atlas is the only system in scope." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_RollbackRehearsalDiscipline> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Narrative_NamedOperationalOwnership> ] ;
    narr:writer "anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6" .
